flowchart LR
  Client[Client player]
  Proxy[SyncTV proxy]
  Provider[External media provider]
  Cache[(slice cache<br/>memory / file)]
  Bypass[Direct pass-through<br/>no full-file cache]

  Client -->|Range request or plain GET| Proxy
  Proxy -->|fixed-size slice requests| Provider
  Provider -->|Range supported| Proxy
  Proxy -->|write / hit slices| Cache
  Cache -->|serve cached bytes| Proxy
  Proxy --> Client
  Provider -. Range unsupported .-> Bypass
  Bypass -. stream .-> Client
